  "measure_description": "Whole dock + robot measured at the wall with a ThirdReality Gen3 plug (2 s / 3 W power reporting, 1 Wh energy counter) over Oct 20-23 2026 runs; activity energies cross-checked against the plug's energy counter. Activities come from the dock's dust_emptying, mop_washing and mop_drying switches and the robot's status and battery. Mop wash value is for the High Temperature setting (small ~78 W heater for ~57 s per wash, ~1.3 Wh); Room Temperature washes draw ~3 W. Robot charging input is rated 20 V / 1 A (20 W), so charging cannot run much above the ~19 W measured; the flat value should hold from any battery level. Robot label: model RRE0PEE, product ID QSP51-01 (US 120 V).",
